# the pre-mutation bytes `tools/mutate.py` holds while a mutation is
# applied. Ignored because it is derived — but if you SEE it, a run was
# killed and a source file is carrying a deliberate defect: `mutate.py
# --restore`.
.mutate-in-flight/
